      "factual_description": "COTTON CLUB presents NAOKO TERAI QUARTET, The Precious Night 2026, on Monday, September 14, 2026, with sets at 6:00 PM and 8:30 PM. The official event page identifies the quartet as Naoko Terai on violin, Naoki Kitajima on piano, Yusuke Nakaishi on bass, and Shota Asai on drums, and frames the performance around the quartet's interplay and Terai's lead violin voice. Web reservations opened August 4 and telephone reservations August 6. The venue lists a table-seat music charge of ¥8,000, with higher-priced box and pair seating also available.",
